e full pattern with query fields, see ",[285,354,356],{"href":355},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#with-listcard","With ListCard"," on ShuoQueryCard.",[307,359,361],{"id":360},"title-and-icon","Title and icon",[281,363,364,367,368,371,372,348,375,379],{},[291,365,366],{},"title"," is the title text and ",[291,369,370],{},"icon"," is the icon to the left of the title; pass an empty string to hide the icon. The title bar wraps by the same rules as ",[291,373,374],{},"ShuoQueryCard",[285,376,378],{"href":377},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#long-titles","Long titles",".",[335,381],{"name":382},"list-card-title",[307,384,386],{"id":385},"pagination-and-counts","Pagination and counts",[281,388,389,392,393,396,397,400],{},[291,390,391],{},"show-pagination"," controls the pagination at the bottom left, shown even with a single page; ",[291,394,395],{},"show-summary"," controls the count and range at the bottom right; ",[291,398,399],{},"page-size"," is the number of rows per page, 10 by default.",[335,402],{"name":403},"list-card-footer",[405,406,407,421],"ul",{},[408,409,410,411,413,414,348,417,379],"li",{},"After changing ",[291,412,399],{},", query again from the first page with ",[291,415,416],{},"getPagination(1)",[285,418,420],{"href":419},"#re-querying-the-current-page","Re-querying the current page",[408,422,423,424,427,428,430],{},"When both pagination and the summary are off, the bottom only shows ",[291,425,426],{},"#footer","; without ",[291,429,426],{},", there is no bottom area.",[307,432,434],{"id":433},"loading-and-empty-data","Loading and empty data",[281,436,437,438,441,442,445,446,449,450,379],{},"When the component is created while loading with no data, skeleton rows are shown; when re-querying with existing data, the data fades and switches with a height transition. ",[291,439,440],{},"empty"," is the empty-data text, using the table default when not set; with ",[291,443,444],{},"transition"," set to ",[291,447,448],{},"fals